  "difficulty_reason": "The remaining task is an explicit recoverable coding of arbitrary countable order types into a constrained arithmetic class of distance sets. It requires selecting the three markers and two linked bands so that all nontrivial triangle constraints remember precisely order, and then recovering both the coding domain and its order by uniform first-order formulas. The standard universality of countable linear orders gives no such triangle gadget or converse recovery.",
